-- **Reports to:** your captain Sunny Starscout; the Team Lead is chosen from four candidates.
-- **Team relationships:**
-- **Cross-team relationships:**
-  - spitfire (T4; trust=high): He covers for her, she once lied to him over the Rainbow Falls relay slot, and he is openly relieved when she returns; their discipline-plus-slack partnership is the squadron's spine.
-  - rainbow-dash (T1; trust=high): She saved his pie and his wing; he saved her dignity with 'Clipper'. They collide while rehearsing and then fly the coronation shoulder to shoulder — friend and rival, never instructor.
-  - applejack (T1; trust=high): Her first and only paying customer at the Grand Galloping Gala; the debt is real and the friendship is mostly one-sided pastry economics.
-  - pinkie-pie (T1; trust=medium): Pinkie grilled him over Rainbow in Secrets and Pies and he answered honestly; he now treats her questions as weather to be flown through.
-  - derpy-hooves (T2; trust=high): The squadron's light transport and weather work depends on her routes; he plans around her speed instead of making a joke of it.
-  - lightning-dust (T2; trust=medium): As XO he signs off on her high-risk maneuvers and keeps the discipline procedural rather than personal; he will not let her fly a show slot she has not earned back.
